  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Stay warm and comfortable this winter with our military-styled N-3B Parka. Featuring a heavy-duty, water-repellent nylon outer shell, this parka jacket easily overcomes rugged terrains and extreme cold weather. From outdoor sports and activities to field missions and emergencies, the snorkel parka will become a must-have for your winter wardrobe.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "8450",
  "description": "<p>Stay warm and comfortable this winter with our military-styled N-3B Parka. Featuring a heavy-duty, water-repellent nylon outer shell, this parka jacket easily overcomes rugged terrains and extreme cold weather. From outdoor sports and activities to field missions and emergencies, the snorkel parka will become a must-have for your winter wardrobe.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Thermal Insulation:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These parka coats come equipped with an extremely warm polyester liner and heavyweight poly fiberfill that keeps the cold out while retaining internal body heat.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Protection From the Elements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Inspired from a field-proven and time-tested design, this winter coat utilizes a drawstring hood with faux fur trim that resembles a snorkel when zipped past your neck. This snorkel hood leaves an opening for visibility while shielding you from the rain, wind, and snow. It also has an adjustment tab for the perfect fit.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Built for Extreme Cold Weather:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The winter parka features a front zipper with a storm flap and a 4-button closure for an impenetrable shield against harsh elements. The soft knit wrist cuffs and interior waistband provide additional heat retention and insulation while keeping the wind out.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Exterior Pockets:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Our cold weather parka jackets offer convenient storage options through two front snap-button slash pockets and two button-flap pockets that are ideal for carrying your phone, wallet, keys, and other everyday carry essentials. The outdoor coat also features a zippered utility sleeve pocket on the left arm with exterior pen holders.</li>\n</ul>",
